{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1096114-chimerical-equivalents-to-the-kithain","id":1096114,"title":"Chimerical equivalents to the Kithain?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-23T17:31:01-07:00","id":1096114,"title":"Chimerical equivalents to the Kithain?","content":"Can the Kithain have chimerical equivalents? I am given to understand that there are &quot;races&quot; of Chimera (I would love some details about how that works) so could there be &quot;authentic&quot; chimerical boggans, pooka, sidhe, and so on or have they all been transformed into Kithain and anything that looks like them are basically cheap knock offs of the original chimera that they hale from that don't have the correct spiritual DNA? Basically. like confusing eels for snakes. Also, could you create a real boggan chimera? What are your thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-23T17:47:50-07:00","id":1096115,"title":"","content":"Well it's been said Chimera are slaves to dreams while Fae are the keepers of dreams. So I go with the knock off option. True kiths if chimerical are True Fae and are not chimera. You could have a goat man chimera but it doesn't have the potential complexity of a true Fae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","ava